; EUR/AED exchange rates.
; Basis for converting invoices, expenses, reverse charge and month-end revaluation: the CBUAE rate
; of the day (art. 69 VAT Decree-Law, FTA VATP004). Source: centralbank.ae, monthly tables fx_<mmm><yy>_en.pdf.
; Wio conversions are not recorded as prices: the actual conversion books itself (@@) and the difference
; from the CBUAE rate is an exchange gain or loss. No estimated rates. Every line has a source.

; CBUAE December 2025 (fx_dec25_en.pdf), last publication day of the year
2025-12-30 price EUR  4.319572 AED
  source: "CBUAE fx_dec25_en.pdf, 30-12-2025"

; Rates 2026 from the CBUAE monthly tables (centralbank.ae/media/.../fx_<mmm>26_en.pdf, 'Exchange Rates against UAE Dirham
; for VAT related obligations'): month-end (last publication day) plus the dates on which an EUR invoice or receipt was converted.
; October 2026: the CBUAE monthly table had not been published on 2-11-2026; no rate, so no line (INV-0012 is flagged '!').
; Weekend days have no CBUAE rate: the last publication day before it is used (stated in the source).

